    <h2>Using our content</h2>
    <p>Our words, design and calculators are © Honest Penny. You're welcome to share links and short quotes with credit and a link. Please don't republish whole guides or present them as your own.</p>

    <h2>Changes and governing law</h2>
    <p>We may update these terms; the date below shows the latest version. These terms are governed by the laws of the Province of Alberta and the federal laws of Canada that apply there.</p>
    <p>Questions: <a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a>.</p>
    <p class="muted">Last updated November 24, 2026.</p>
